{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前港姐季軍郭柏妍昨日（10月27日）於社交平台分享一段示範唯美拍照技巧短片，短短時間已累積1萬9千觀看次數。一 …</p><p></p>\n<p>前港姐季軍郭柏妍昨日（10月27日）於社交平台分享一段示範唯美拍照技巧短片，短短時間已累積1萬9千觀看次數。一向走清純路線的她今次破格換上一襲銀色低胸鑲鑽晚裝，在充滿水氣玻璃前擺姿勢時卻引發全網哄動。有網民定格畫面後發現其動作幅度過大，導致邊緣位置出現了意想不到失守畫面。\n</p>\n<h2>郭柏妍銀色低胸鑲鑽晚裝展現成熟感</h2>\n<p>短片中郭柏妍親自示範如何利用簡單場景拍出充滿朦朧美感人像，畫面配上「拍照沒招？試試看」字句。她走到一塊布滿水氣玻璃前，面露甜美笑容並伸手抹走表面水珠，隨後便隔着玻璃擺出各種充滿仙氣姿勢。不過該件銀色晚裝剪裁極具挑戰性，當她傾前抹玻璃及不斷轉換姿勢時動作較大，令服裝領口邊緣處於極限狀態。</p>\n<h2>粉絲湧入留言區激讚照片極具質感</h2>\n<p>面對這段引發熱討論短片，雖然郭柏妍尚未就疑似走光一事作出官方回應，但一眾支持者已經迅速在留言區洗版。大批粉絲紛紛湧入社交平台為偶像護航，將焦點放回拍攝效果之上，並留言直指「照片極具質感」。不少支持者更留言誇讚她今次大膽嘗試，指出這身打扮成功讓她擺脫過往既定印象散發出截然不同成熟女人味。\n</p>\n<h2>前港姐季軍郭柏妍破格挑戰性感底線</h2>\n<p>頂著前港姐季軍頭銜入行以來，郭柏妍一直以清純甜美氣質示人，並憑藉得天獨厚外在條件維持高企人氣。過往她多以乖乖女形象出席各大公開場合，鮮有作如此大膽低胸打扮。這次她突然轉換風格穿上剪裁極其貼身晚裝上陣，強烈視覺反差立刻成為大眾討論焦點，更意外因為服裝移位問題引發大規模網絡熱議。</p>\n<h2>網民直指郭柏妍動作過大疑似露出胸墊</h2>\n<p>短片發布後迅速在各大討論區引起熱烈討論，不少人將焦點放在她伸手抹水珠一幕。有眼利網民反覆觀看該1萬9千點擊率片段後，指出她在傾斜身體時疑似「失守」，並留言表示她「露出了走光邊緣胸墊」。網上輿論呈現兩極化，部分人留言表示拍攝唯美照片時難免會有大動作，另一派則留言指出藝人發布影片前應該仔細檢查畫面。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000364539326_646943536ae17344193c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_02p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000364539326_646943536ae17344193c4.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000488047269_20408143486ae17345573af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000488047269_20408143486ae17345573af.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_05p.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000576182493_20915869176ae173461daa6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261027170135803-1027_00862_001_06p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000576182493_20915869176ae173461daa6.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000675432237_16084109276ae173474f40b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"rositakpyy_1791028495_3999755920363235059_1457706649.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316000675432237_16084109276ae173474f40b.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316001022153132_13133220046ae1734a87d2a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"rositakpyy_1791028495_3999759318991019024_1457706649.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316001022153132_13133220046ae1734a87d2a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%8e%e8%83%b8%e6%99%9a%e8%a3%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">低胸晚裝</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b5%b0%e5%85%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">走光</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e6%9f%8f%e5%a6%8d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭柏妍</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531364\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:45.382268+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1230,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:41.611436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:41.611436+00:00","content_hash":"fbdcd83259d257d9924c3aa370d2338aac12925b247abb5d2a8ef78f1fec94de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}